---
// Self-reinforcing feedback loops in predictive analytics and pricing systems
// (DDIA Ch. 14: credit/employment spiral, welfare/policing audits, German gas bots).
// Plain inline SVG with site CSS tokens; polygon arrowheads (no marker ids).

const W = 900;
const H = 456;

function arrow(x1: number, y1: number, x2: number, y2: number) {
  const a = Math.atan2(y2 - y1, x2 - x1);
  const len = 8;
  const p1 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a - 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a - 0.45)];
  const p2 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a + 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a + 0.45)];
  return {
    line: `M ${x1} ${y1} L ${(x2 - 6 * Math.cos(a)).toFixed(1)} ${(y2 - 6 * Math.sin(a)).toFixed(1)}`,
    head: `${x2},${y2} ${p1[0].toFixed(1)},${p1[1].toFixed(1)} ${p2[0].toFixed(1)},${p2[1].toFixed(1)}`,
  };
}

// 2x2 feedback loop on the left (x: 20..540)
const a12 = arrow(250, 127, 310, 127);
const a23 = arrow(425, 170, 425, 274);
const a34 = arrow(310, 317, 250, 317);
const a41 = arrow(135, 274, 135, 170);
---
<figure class="efl">
  <div class="efl-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Systems thinking diagram showing a 4-step self-reinforcing feedback loop: skewed history feeds biased model predictions, which trigger real-world penalties, which log worse outcomes back as ground truth, alongside three real-world examples.">
      <text x="20" y="24" class="efl-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>How predictions become self-fulfilling feedback loops</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Khi dự đoán tự động tạo thành vòng lặp tự ứng nghiệm</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="20" y="46" class="efl-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Systems thinking looks past the model box to see how decisions reshape tomorrow's training data.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tư duy hệ thống nhìn rộng ra khỏi mô hình để thấy quyết định hôm nay đang nắn dữ liệu ngày mai.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Node 1: Top-left */}
      <rect x="20" y="84" width="230" height="86" rx="8" class="efl-box" />
      <text x="34" y="109" class="efl-box-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Skewed baseline</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Dữ liệu gốc lệch</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="34" y="131" class="efl-small">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Historical inequality sits in</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bất bình đẳng cũ nằm sẵn</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="34" y="150" class="efl-small">
        <tspan data-lang-en>today's training records.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>trong tập huấn luyện ban đầu.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Node 2: Top-right */}
      <rect x="310" y="84" width="230" height="86" rx="8" class="efl-box" />
      <text x="324" y="109" class="efl-box-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Asymmetric scores</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Chấm điểm bất cân xứng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="324" y="131" class="efl-small">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Model assigns higher risk to</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mô hình gán rủi ro cao hơn</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="324" y="150" class="efl-small">
        <tspan data-lang-en>one group via proxy traits.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>cho một nhóm qua biến đại diện.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Node 3: Bottom-right (red highlight) */}
      <rect x="310" y="274" width="230" height="86" rx="8" class="efl-box is-hot" />
      <text x="324" y="299" class="efl-box-h is-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>3. Real-world penalty</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>3. Hệ quả ngoài đời thật</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="324" y="321" class="efl-small">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Job denied, extra fraud audits,</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Rớt việc, bị kiểm tra gắt gao,</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="324" y="340" class="efl-small">
        <tspan data-lang-en>or rival bot matches higher price.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>hoặc bot đối thủ nâng giá theo.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Node 4: Bottom-left */}
      <rect x="20" y="274" width="230" height="86" rx="8" class="efl-box" />
      <text x="34" y="299" class="efl-box-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>4. Poisoned feedback</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>4. Phản hồi bị đầu độc</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="34" y="321" class="efl-small">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Unpaid bills or audit hits are</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nợ trễ hạn hay lỗi ghi nhận</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="34" y="340" class="efl-small">
        <tspan data-lang-en>logged as "ground truth".</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>lại thành "bằng chứng" mới.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Loop arrows */}
      <g class="efl-arrow"><path d={a12.line} /><polygon points={a12.head} /></g>
      <g class="efl-arrow"><path d={a23.line} /><polygon points={a23.head} /></g>
      <g class="efl-arrow"><path d={a34.line} /><polygon points={a34.head} /></g>
      <g class="efl-arrow is-red"><path d={a41.line} /><polygon points={a41.head} /></g>

      <text x="148" y="218" class="efl-loop-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Retraining amplifies</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Huấn luyện lại càng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="148" y="236" class="efl-loop-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>the initial disparity</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>khoét sâu chênh lệch</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right column: real-world loops */}
      <line x1="564" x2="564" y1="84" y2="360" class="efl-divider" />

      <rect x="582" y="84" width="298" height="84" rx="6" class="efl-case" />
      <text x="596" y="108" class="efl-box-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Credit &amp; hiring spiral (DDIA Ch. 14)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Vòng xoáy tín dụng - việc làm (DDIA)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="596" y="130" class="efl-small">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Missed bills → lower score → denied job</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trễ hóa đơn → tụt điểm → rớt việc</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="596" y="149" class="efl-small">
        <tspan data-lang-en>→ deeper debt → even lower score.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>→ thiếu tiền → điểm càng tụt sâu.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="582" y="180" width="298" height="84" rx="6" class="efl-case" />
      <text x="596" y="204" class="efl-box-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Welfare fraud audits (Netherlands)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Kiểm tra phúc lợi (Hà Lan)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="596" y="226" class="efl-small">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Dual-nationality flag → harsher audits</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cờ song tịch → bị thanh tra gắt hơn</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="596" y="245" class="efl-small">
        <tspan data-lang-en>→ clerical slips logged as "fraud".</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>→ lỗi giấy tờ bị ghi thành "gian lận".</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="582" y="276" width="298" height="84" rx="6" class="efl-case" />
      <text x="596" y="300" class="efl-box-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Gas pricing bots (Germany, 2024)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bot định giá xăng (Đức, 2024)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="596" y="322" class="efl-small">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Bot raises price → rival bot follows</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bot nâng giá → bot đối thủ nâng theo</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="596" y="341" class="efl-small">
        <tspan data-lang-en>→ duopoly margins rise ~28% silently.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>→ biên lãi cặp cạnh tranh tăng ~28%.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Bottom takeaway */}
      <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="392" y2="392" class="efl-divider" />
      <text x="20" y="420" class="efl-takeaway">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Systems thinking rule: ask whether your pipeline reduces disparity or turns small gaps into runaway spirals.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Quy tắc tư duy hệ thống: luôn hỏi pipeline của mình đang thu hẹp khoảng cách hay biến lệch nhỏ thành vòng xoáy.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Predictive systems rarely sit passively outside society: their decisions alter the world they observe next. Sources: DDIA chapter 14 (credit-to-unemployment spiral), Amnesty International (2021, Dutch childcare benefits), and Assad et al. (Journal of Political Economy 2024, German retail gasoline algorithmic pricing).</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Hệ thống dự đoán hiếm khi đứng ngoài xã hội một cách thụ động: quyết định của nó làm thay đổi chính thế giới mà nó sẽ quan sát ở vòng sau. Nguồn: chương 14 DDIA, Amnesty International (2021, Hà Lan), và Assad et al. (2024, giá xăng thuật toán ở Đức).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .efl {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .efl-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .efl svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 640px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .efl text {
    font-size: 14px;
    fill: var(--text-body);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .efl .efl-h {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .efl .efl-sub {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .efl-box,
  .efl-case {
    fill: var(--bg-alt);
    stroke: var(--text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }
  .efl-case {
    stroke: var(--border);
  }
  .efl-box.is-hot {
    fill: var(--red-tint-bg);
    stroke: var(--red);
    stroke-width: 1.6;
  }
  .efl .efl-box-h {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .efl .efl-box-h.is-red {
    fill: var(--red);
  }
  .efl .efl-small {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .efl-arrow path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .efl-arrow polygon {
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .efl-arrow.is-red path {
    stroke: var(--red);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .efl-arrow.is-red polygon {
    fill: var(--red);
  }
  .efl .efl-loop-note {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--red);
  }
  .efl-divider {
    stroke: var(--border);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .efl .efl-takeaway {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .efl figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
